---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Accéder à la bêta Sténtor - Stentor" description="Demandez l’accès à la bêta privée de Sténtor pour un usage individuel, des théâtres, compagnies, festivals, écoles et institutions." active={null} showNav={false} showFooter={false}>
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-black text-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 [background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(239,68,68,0.22)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] [-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom_right,#000_0%,transparent_62%)] [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom_right,#000_0%,transparent_62%)] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-[-18%] top-[-18%] w-[560px] h-[560px] rounded-full bg-red-500/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <header class="relative max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-7 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/fr/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-white hover:text-white/80 transition-colors"><span class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-xl">STENTOR</span><span class="text-white/45 text-sm">Bêta</span></a>
      <a href="/fr/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/55 hover:text-white transition-colors"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Retour au site</a>
    </header>

    <main class="relative max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-10 pb-20">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <p class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-red-400 mb-4">Bêta privée</p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[72px] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.06em] font-semibold max-w-[680px]">Accéder à la bêta Sténtor.</h1>
        <p class="text-white/55 text-lg leading-[1.55] mt-6 max-w-[600px]">Indiquez si vous utiliserez Sténtor individuellement ou pour une organisation. Pendant la bêta, chaque accès est approuvé manuellement avant téléchargements et activations.</p>
        <p class="text-white/45 mt-4">Vous avez déjà une licence ? <a href="/fr/acces" class="text-red-400 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-red-300">Se connecter →</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6"><a href="#request-form" class="auth-provider"><img src="/brand/google.svg" alt="" class="provider-logo" /> Continuer avec Google</a><a href="#request-form" class="auth-provider"><img src="/brand/microsoft.svg" alt="" class="provider-logo" /> Continuer avec Microsoft</a></div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-white/35 -mt-3 mb-6">Google et Microsoft sont en préparation. Pour l’instant, complétez la demande bêta ci-dessous.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 my-7 text-white/35 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></span> demande bêta <span class="h-px bg-white/10 flex-1"></span></div>

      <div id="request-form" class="scroll-mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.045] backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-red-950/10">
        <div data-beta-success hidden class="p-8 sm:p-10 text-center"><div class="mx-auto w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-400/10 border border-green-400/25 flex items-center justify-center text-green-300 mb-5">✓</div><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] mb-3">Demande bêta enregistrée</h2><p class="text-white/55 leading-[1.6] max-w-[460px] mx-auto">Votre demande est maintenant dans la file bêta de Sténtor. Après approbation, l’espace compte affichera licence, téléchargements et instructions d’activation.</p><a href="/fr/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center mt-7 h-11 px-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-sm text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors">Retour au site</a></div>
        <form data-beta-form class="p-6 sm:p-8 grid gap-5" novalidate>
          <fieldset class="grid gap-3"><legend class="auth-label">Comment utiliserez-vous Sténtor ?</legend><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><label class="account-type-option"><input type="radio" name="account_type" value="individual" class="accent-red-500" checked /><span><strong>Individuel</strong><small>J’utilise Sténtor seul.</small></span></label><label class="account-type-option"><input type="radio" name="account_type" value="organization" class="accent-red-500" /><span><strong>Organisation</strong><small>Je représente un théâtre, une compagnie, un festival, une école, une université ou une équipe.</small></span></label></div></fieldset>
          <div><label class="auth-label" for="name">Nom et prénom</label><input id="name" name="full_name" required type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Ada Lovelace" autocomplete="name" /></div>
          <div><label class="auth-label" for="email">E-mail professionnel</label><input id="email" name="email" required type="email" class="auth-input" placeholder="nom@theatre.fr" autocomplete="email" /></div>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div data-organization-only><label class="auth-label" for="organization">Organisation</label><input id="organization" name="organization_name" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Théâtre, compagnie, festival" autocomplete="organization" /></div><div><label class="auth-label" for="role">Rôle</label><input id="role" name="role" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Production, accessibilité" /></div></div>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div><label class="auth-label" for="country">Pays</label><input id="country" name="country" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="France" /></div><div data-organization-only><label class="auth-label" for="seats">Utilisateurs prévus</label><input id="seats" name="requested_seats" type="number" min="1" value="1" class="auth-input" /></div></div>
          <fieldset class="grid gap-2"><legend class="auth-label">Plateformes</legend><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-white/60"><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="macos" checked class="accent-red-500" /> macOS</label><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="windows" class="accent-red-500" /> Windows</label><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="linux" class="accent-red-500" /> Linux</label></div></fieldset>
          <div><label class="auth-label" for="expected_use">Usage prévu</label><input id="expected_use" name="expected_use" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Répétition, festival, projet accessibilité..." /></div>
          <div><label class="auth-label" for="message">Comment souhaitez-vous utiliser Sténtor ?</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" class="auth-input auth-textarea" placeholder="Indiquez la production, la période d’essai et la configuration souhaitée."></textarea></div>
          <p data-beta-error hidden class="rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 text-red-200 text-sm leading-[1.5] p-4"></p>
          <button type="submit" data-loading-label="Enregistrement..." class="h-14 rounded-xl bg-red-500 text-black font-semibold text-[15px] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(239,68,68,0.18)] hover:bg-red-400 transition-colors disabled:opacity-60">Demander l’accès bêta →</button>
        </form>
      </div>
      <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-7 text-white/45 text-sm"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Aucune carte requise</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Licence d’essai après approbation</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Conçu pour production live</li></ul>
    </main>
  </section>
</Layout>
<script>
  import { setupBetaRequestForm } from '../../lib/betaRequestForm';
  setupBetaRequestForm({ formSelector: '[data-beta-form]', successSelector: '[data-beta-success]', errorSelector: '[data-beta-error]' });
</script>
<style>
  @reference "../../styles/global.css";
  .auth-provider { @apply h-14 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.045] hover:bg-white/[0.075] hover:border-white/20 transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-white/90; }
  .provider-logo { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; display: block; }
  .auth-label { @apply block text-[13px] font-medium text-white/62 mb-2; }
  .auth-input { @apply w-full h-12 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-white outline-none transition-all text-[15px]; padding: 0 16px; }
  .auth-input:focus { border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.55); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12); }
  .auth-input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.34); }
  .auth-textarea { height: auto; padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; resize: none; }
  .account-type-option { @apply min-h-24 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/25 p-4 flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer hover:border-red-400/35 hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors; }
  .account-type-option input { margin-top: 3px; }
  .account-type-option span { @apply grid gap-1; }
  .account-type-option strong { @apply text-white font-semibold; }
  .account-type-option small { @apply text-white/58 leading-[1.45] text-sm; }
</style>
